#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:51
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HowManyKindsOfPokemon"
msgid ""
"I wonder how many kinds of POKéMON\n"
"there are in the world.\p"
"It'd be great to cross seas and\n"
"trade POKéMON with people far away.$"
msgstr ""
"不知道世界上\n"
"一共有多少种宝可梦呢。\p"
"要是能跨越大海，和远方的人\n"
"交换宝可梦就好了。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HeardAboutRottenScoundrels"
msgid ""
"I've been hearing about some rotten\n"
"scoundrels who steal POKéMON and rip\l"
"off METEORITES.$"
msgstr ""
"我听说有一群卑鄙的坏蛋，\n"
"到处偷宝可梦，还抢走陨石。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HaventSeenRottenScoundrels"
msgid ""
"Those rotten scoundrels who steal\n"
"POKéMON and rip off METEORITES…\p"
"I haven't seen them around recently.$"
msgstr ""
"那群偷宝可梦、\n"
"抢陨石的卑鄙坏蛋……\p"
"最近都没看到他们了。$"
